emerhub.bali|https://www.instagram.com/p/DVZ0xBJEkwy/|2026-03-03|carousel|5|Bali Criminalizes Rice Field Conversions.\\n\\nUnder Regional Regulation No. 4 of 2026, converting protected agricultural land (LP2B) into commercial properties including villas  is now a criminal offense. This is no longer just an administrative issue.\\n\\nThe government is also intensifying its crackdown on nominee agreements, especially in key Subak areas like Tabanan and Gianyar. Land conversion permits are frozen, and zoning enforcement is tightening.\\n\\nFor property investors, developing on Green Zone or LP2B land may now carry criminal liability, land confiscation, and prosecution.\\n\\nZoning due diligence is more critical than ever.\\n\\n\uc0\u55357 \u56524  Save this update if you invest in Bali property\\n\u55357 \u56492  Need clarity on land zoning? Contact us\\n\\n#BaliProperty #LP2B #BaliRegulation #NomineeRisk #GreenZoneBali|#BaliProperty #LP2B #BaliRegulation #NomineeRisk #GreenZoneBali|Bali Criminalizes Rice Field Conversions.|58|14||09:16|fonte=dom ; viral outlier (58 likes vs avg ~10 untuk post sebelumnya) ; bahasa=en\
emerhub.bali|https://www.instagram.com/p/DVX4MJwkvfZ/|2026-03-02|carousel|7|\uc0\u10024  March in Bali: A Month of Sacred Contrast \u55356 \u57088 \\n\\nFrom the vibrant spirit of Tumpek Wayang to the rhythmic seaside processions of Melasti, Bali this March is a powerful journey into the island's soul. \u55356 \u57146 \\n\\nThis month, we witness a rare alignment: the thunderous energy of the Ogoh-Ogoh parades followed by the profound, breathtaking silence of Nyepi (the Day of Silence). As the island falls into stillness, our Muslim community also prepares to celebrate Idul Fitri, making this a truly historic time of reflection and harmony. \u9878 \u65039 \\n\\nWhich part of the March magic are you most excited to experience? The giant parades or the night of a thousand stars? \u55357 \u56391 ||\u10024  March in Bali: A Month of Sacred Contrast \u55356 \u57088 |hidden|0||15:07|fonte=dom ; like_count hidden (ikon tanpa angka) ; bahasa=en\
