nomadsembassy|https://www.instagram.com/p/CMKG76pKEtf/|2021-03-08|static||This photo is a lie... \uc0\u55358 \u56623 \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nSo many people think that being a digital nomad means working on their laptops at the beach. But, for most of us, it's the most uncomfortable place to work \u55356 \u57302  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWhen we took this photo, it was hot, our computer was getting overheated, and it was difficult to concentrate \u55357 \u56867 \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWhile there are some digital nomads who can make it work and be comfortable, for most of us, this isn't what our lives look like. \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nInstead, we sit in cafes, coworking spaces, or stay in our apartments/AirBnBs/hostels. This is the reality of living and working as a digital nomad \u55356 \u57102  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWhat questions or misconceptions do you have about the digital nomad lifestyle? Leave them in the comments below \u55357 \u56391 \u55357 \u56391 ||This photo is a lie... \u55358 \u56623 \u8291 |38|4||20:35|fonte=json ; bahasa=en\
