nomadsembassy|https://www.instagram.com/p/CL9OY0Wq1hx/|2021-03-03|carousel|2|Meet the minds behind Nomads Embassy! \uc0\u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nJack Gomarasca and Brittany Loeffler are the co-founders are Nomads Embassy. \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nJack is originally from Milan, Italy \u55356 \u56814 \u55356 \u56825  and has been a digital nomad for 6 years. \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nBrittany is originally from Philadelphia, USA \u55356 \u56826 \u55356 \u56824  and has been a digital nomad for 3 years. \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWe met in Barcelona \u55356 \u56810 \u55356 \u56824  in the summer of 2019 while we were both traveling. After discovering we had the same passion for the digital nomad lifestyle, we decided we wanted to help people achieve it for themselves \u55358 \u56605  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nThis brought us to the birth of the idea for Nomads Embassy in March 2020 \u55357 \u56481  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nSince then, we've been working hard to figure out what digital nomads need right now \u55358 \u56596  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nOur mission is to make it easy to become a digital nomad because nobody deserves to go through the journey alone as we did! \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWe want to offer 24/7 support \u9742 \u65039  to digital nomads and a global community \u55356 \u57102  as well as exclusive discounts and offers \u55357 \u56501   to Nomads Embassy members. \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nWe have a lot of exciting plans for the next year and hope you follow us to stay in the loop! \u9854  \u8291 \\n\u8291 \\nFind out more on our website: nomadsembassy.com||Meet the minds behind Nomads Embassy! \u8291 |63|5||20:30|fonte=json ; bahasa=en\
